OL,3,GNEWSABeauty boss condemns the ugly side
OL,4,Aof social media
OL,5,
OL,6,FA make-up artist and beauty brand
OL,7,Ffounder has condemned "cruel" online
OL,8,Ftrolls who flooded his social media
OL,9,Faccounts after he came up with a red
OL,10,Fcarpet look for reality star Katie
OL,11,FPrice.
OL,13,FMitchell Halliday, who created the
OL,14,Fmake-up brand Made By Mitchell and has
OL,15,Fworked with the likes of Kim
OL,16,FKardashian, received tens of thousands
OL,17,Fof comments on a video of the makeover,
OL,18,Fsome of which he said were "too vile"
OL,19,Fto repeat.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
