OL,3,GNEWSABeauty boss condemns the ugly side
OL,4,Aof social media
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalliday, from Bolton, said: "I've seen
OL,7,Fa lot of social media so it doesn't
OL,8,Freally shock me anymore - but the women
OL,9,Ftalking about Katie struck me.
OL,11,F"Some of it was just so vile and just
OL,12,Fstraight to the attack."
